n><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab\">CommandElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.elabRunCmd","kind":"def","line":310,"name":"Lean.Elab.Command.elabRunCmd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L310-L317"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.elabEvalBang\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Command</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabEvalBang</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab\">CommandElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.elabEvalBang","kind":"def","line":305,"name":"Lean.Elab.Command.elabEvalBang","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L305-L308"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.elabEval\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Command</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabEval</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab\">CommandElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.elabEval","kind":"def","line":300,"name":"Lean.Elab.Command.elabEval","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L300-L303"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.elabEvalCore\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Command</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabEvalCore</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">bang</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">tk </span><span class=\"fn\">term</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">expectedType?</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mkMessage</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">silenceUnit</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElabM\">CommandElabM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Implements an `#eval`-like command, as follows.\n\nThe input `term` is elaborated to `e`,\nand `mkMessage`—which should produce a `MessageData`—is invoked to render `e`.\nWhen `e : m α` is a monadic action,\nand `m` lifts to one of `CommandElabM`, `TermElabM`, `MetaM`, `CoreM` or `IO` through `MonadEvalT`,\n`mkMessage` receives the return value of `e`; otherwise it receives `e`.\nThe resulting message is evaluated and logged at `tk`.\n\nEvaluation is aborted if `e` depends on `sorryAx` and `bang` is not set.\n\n`mkMessage` may `throwUnsupportedSyntax` to signal that other elaborators should be attempted.\n\nWhen `e` is a monadic action, `α ≡ Unit`, and `silenceUnit` is set,\n`mkMessage` is skipped and no message is shown.\n\nWhen the environment doesn't contain `MessageData.ofFormat` (e.g. in the prelude),\n`Repr/ToString` instances rather than `mkMessage` are used to render the value.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.elabEvalCore","kind":"opaque","line":276,"name":"Lean.Elab.Command.elabEvalCore","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L276-L298"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.elabEvalCoreUnsafe\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Command</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabEvalCoreUnsafe</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">bang</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">tk </span><span class=\"fn\">term</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">expectedType?</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mkMessage</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">silenceUnit</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElabM\">CommandElabM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.elabEvalCoreUnsafe","kind":"def","line":179,"name":"Lean.Elab.Command.elabEvalCoreUnsafe","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L179-L274"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.eval.derive.repr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Command</span>.<span class=\"name\">eval</span>.<span class=\"name\">derive</span>.<span class=\"name\">repr</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Options.html#Lean.Option\">Lean.Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.eval.derive.repr","kind":"opaque","line":34,"name":"Lean.Elab.Command.eval.derive.repr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L34-L37"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.eval.type\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Command</span>.<span class=\"name\">eval</span>.<span class=\"name\">type</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Options.html#Lean.Option\">Lean.Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.eval.type","kind":"opaque","line":29,"name":"Lean.Elab.Command.eval.type","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L29-L32"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.eval.pp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Command</span>.<span class=\"name\">eval</span>.<span class=\"name\">pp</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Options.html#Lean.Option\">Lean.Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.html#Lean.Elab.Command.eval.pp","kind":"opaque","line":23,"name":"Lean.Elab.Command.eval.pp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Elab/BuiltinEvalCommand.lean#L23-L27"}}],"imports":["Lean.Compiler.Options","Lean.Elab.ErrorUtils","Lean.Elab.MutualDef","Lean.Meta.Reduce"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.BuiltinEvalCommand"}